{%- comment -%}
  Section contract.
  What the Store Audit report contains, plus the rating legend.
{%- endcomment -%}
<section id="report" class="{% if section.settings.alt %}alt{% endif %}">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-h">
      <h2>{{ section.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>
      <p>Built so you can act on page one. Every finding points at real data from your store.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rep-grid">
      <div class="card rep">
        <h3>In your report</h3>
        <ul class="ticks">
          <li>Cuadra Fabric Health Score from 0 to 100, with how many areas we could measure</li>
          <li>3 things you should fix today, with where to fix them in Shopify</li>
          <li>A scorecard rating all 13 areas</li>
          <li>For every issue: what's wrong, why it matters, and what to do next</li>
          <li>Key numbers from your store: traffic, add-to-cart, orders, margin, and more</li>
          <li>What we couldn't check, and what it would take to check it</li>
          <li>A plan for this week and this month</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="legend">
        <div class="card lg" style="--c:var(--red)"><h4><i class="dot d-r"></i>Critical</h4><p>Losing money or trust right now, or blocking sales.</p></div>
        <div class="card lg" style="--c:var(--amber)"><h4><i class="dot d-a"></i>Needs attention</h4><p>A real leak or risk worth fixing this month.</p></div>
        <div class="card lg" style="--c:var(--green)"><h4><i class="dot d-g"></i>Healthy</h4><p>No confirmed issue in this area.</p></div>
        <div class="card lg" style="--c:var(--mute)"><h4><i class="dot d-m"></i>Not measured</h4><p>We couldn't check it, and we tell you why instead of guessing.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Cuadra · Audit report",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "What's in your Store Audit" },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "alt", "label": "Alternate background", "default": true }
  ],
  "presets": [ { "name": "Cuadra · Audit report" } ]
}
{% endschema %}
